# C1: CHURN under the reservation on the epochs arm c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-hostgap-2 (the C1 lengths of tp4-262k8-best-jobs): sixteen users over eight seats - three 253,920, three 200,000, 131,072, 65,536, 32,768, 16,384, 8,192,
# 4,096, then 253,920, 200,000, 131,072 and a short 1,536 - every budget 1,024 with ignore_eos, started 30 s apart. THE REVIEW'S D14 READ: the share of [PACKED-HOSTGAP-VERIFY] lines on path=diff, and the count of every
# non-diff reason ('epoch:admission', 'epoch:detach', 'epoch:prefill', 'epoch:prefill-chunk', 'epoch:bookkeeping', 'epoch:lane-switch' are the expected external writers; 'no-snapshot', 'epoch:verify' and 'destinations' are
# misses): under churn the lever must keep its diff share on the rounds no event touched, and no churn event may be followed by a wrong answer. READ also: zero aborts, zero refusals, zero engine deaths, every seat answering
# after the streams; a 'kv reservation hold' followed by 'released'; reserved + running <= pool on every KV line; zero audit mismatches where the profile logs any. No reference comparison. Soft job (it never stops the window).
# Duration (estimate): 240 min.
# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/hostgap eight-seat host-gap window (scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over
# .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/hostgap and push a tag experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a
# registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is pushed from this branch by its author.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-hostgap-1 is what B0 builds from the pushed tp4/hostgap commit; every later job serves that one image. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset gate
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-hostgap-1
C2_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-hostgap-2
C2_GATE_PLAN=churn
C2_GATE_LENGTHS=253920,253920,253920,200000,200000,200000,131072,65536,32768,16384,8192,4096,253920,200000,131072,1536
C2_GATE_MAX_TOKENS=1024
C2_GATE_JIT=record
C2_GATE_AUDITS=extent
